# Can We Do Even Better?

Yes.

Sorting itself costs

```
O(N log N)
```

We actually don't need the whole sorted array.

We only need

* largest number
* second largest
* third largest

and

* smallest number
* second smallest

These five numbers are enough.

So we can find them in **one traversal**.

