| ------------------ | -------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Brute Force        | **O(N³)**      | **O(1)**                                       | Check every combination of three numbers.                                                                   |
| Sorting            | **O(N log N)** | **O(1)** (auxiliary, implementation-dependent) | Sort, then compare the product of the three largest with the product of the two smallest and the largest.   |
